            <ArticleTitle>Quadruplication of dystopic kidney in combination with ureteral cyst.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e13-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.jpedsurg.2008.08.032</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of ureteral quadruplication associated with renal dystopia is described. Four ureters drained into ureteric cyst and distal monoureter opened into the bladder. The literature concerned this extremely rare malformation is reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
